        "notes": "Classic 6ft A-frame picnic table: 72x28.5 top at 29\", benches at 17\" spanning 62\" overall. Each end is an A of two 2x6 legs splayed 30°, their wide faces outward, with both ends cut at 30° so the feet sit flat and the tops meet the tabletop flat. The cleats and bench supports bolt to the legs' faces, the slats rest on them, and two 2x4 braces run from the bench supports up beside the centre stringer, cut to sit square against the support and flat under the top.",
